---
config:
  theme: dark
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: '#ffcc00'
    primaryTextColor: '#003366'
    lineColor: '#008800'
    secondaryColor: '#99ccff'
    tertiaryColor: '#ffe6f0'
    background: '#fff2cc'
description: >-
  baseline/themes/dark.mmd, the representative sequence diagram, under base-colour overrides in the dark theme
  (#1035, D656): the activation keeps lighten(mainBkg, 16) under the secondaryColor override, as in v12
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web
  participant D@{ "type": "database" }
  box Back end
    participant A as API
  end
  U->>+W: open
  W->>A: request
  alt found
    A->>D: query
    D-->>A: rows
  else missing
    A--xW: not found
  end
  note over W,A: retries once
  A-)W: event
  W-->>-U: page
